actually IS!\n\nGOOD LUCK!\n\n"
				},
			[380] = 
				{
					name = "MARAUDER GOTHMAU",
					mechanic = "|t24:24:xynode/icons/xynode_boss_over.dds|t|cffff00 MARAUDER GOTHMAU |r|t24:24:xynode/icons/xynode_boss_over.dds|t\n\nMarauder Gothmau as you MAY know on LIVE stream as 'F**ky Mc Four Arms' or 'FMFA'. THIS boss is HELL! Some people may be able to face tank him if they are built to be a STRONG tank, a DPS build however, will most definitely will NOT!\n\n|cffff00Mechanics|r\n\nThe SAFEST way to fight this guy is to KITE him! Stay OUT of his reach, but be warned, ONE of his attacks will still reach you!\n\nSo basically in order, he has a SWING and then a SECOND SWING, followed by a heavy attack. If these were dodged, or avoided in anyway, well done... NOW get ready for the throwing axe to the back of the head. Dodge or block that and you're good. get some distance and he will have to catch you to repeat the process (demonstrated in the video). He will occasionally spin into a whirlwind-type attack in YOUR direction, but you can step out of this giving you room to walk around him and gain distance, and sometimes he will cast fire winds, which again, is a channel and gives you time to move.\n\nBear in mind, while the above are all avoidable mechanics, you will nuke your stamina dodging all the time, so practice is key here as is luck!\n\nkeep your distance, don't let him touch you, take your time, and pace it. PANIC will kill you. 100% guaranteed. ONE light attack will basically kill you unless you have rapid heals, high damage shields, and big resistances because his bleed that comes from it, is basically two ticks and done!\n\nBiggest tip for this boss outside of kiting him and using your agility to your advantage while not being hit? PRAY.  He is the MOST feared enemy in the Elder Scrolls Online. FACT!\n\n",
					iamechanic = "|t24:24:xynode/icons/xynode_boss_over.dds|t|cffff00 MARAUDER GOTHMAU |r|t24:24:xynode/icons/xynode_boss_over.dds|t\n\nMarauder Gothmau as you MAY know on LIVE stream as 'F**ky Mc Four Arms' or 'FMFA'. THIS boss is HELL! Some people may be able to face tank him if they are built to be a STRONG tank, a DPS build however, will most definitely will NOT!\n\n|cffff00Mechanics|r\n\nThe SAFEST way to fight this guy is to KITE him! Stay OUT of his reach, but be warned, ONE of his attacks will still reach you!\n\nSo basically in order, he has a SWING and then a SECOND SWING, followed by a heavy attack. If these were dodged, or avoided in anyway, well done... NOW get ready for the throwing axe to the back of the head. Dodge or block that and you're good. get some distance and he will have to catch you to repeat the process (demonstrated in the video). He will occasionally spin into a whirlwind-type attack in YOUR direction, but you can step out of this giving you room to walk around him and gain distance, and sometimes he will cast fire winds, which again, is a channel and gives you time to move.\n\nBear in mind, while the above are all avoidable mechanics, you will nuke your stamina dodging all the time, so practice is key here as is luck!\n\nkeep your distance, don't let him touch you, take your time, and pace it. PANIC will kill you. 100% guaranteed. ONE light attack will basically kill you unless you have rapid heals, high damage shields, and big resistances because his bleed that comes from it, is basically two ticks and done!\n\nBiggest tip for this boss outside of kiting him and using your agility to your advantage while not being hit? PRAY.  He is the MOST feared enemy in the Elder Scrolls Online. FACT!\n\n"
				},
			[381] = 
				{
					name = "MARAUDER HILKARAX",
					mechanic = "|t24:24:xynode/icons/xynode_boss_over.dds|t|cffff00 MARAUDER HILKARAX |r|t24:24:xynode/icons/xynode_boss_over.dds|t\n\nMarauder Hilkarax is who we refer to on stream as 'Windy B*llocks', he can make the WHOLE room hate you. So watch your feet!\n\n|cffff00Mechanics|r\n\nOutside of his light and heavy attacks which should be blocked or dodge rolled, this boss does TWO major different attacks.  The first one is a Geyser that he spawns that spits a large fast-moving circular aoe in front of him. When he does this, simply stand out of his face and let it pass.\n\nThe second major mechanic is he will spin in the air and fill the room with multiple winds that spin all over the place. You need to watch your feet and avoid them. BUT look carefully at his feet. Where he CASTS this, there is a very slow-moving wind that moves around in a circle. Stay close to him and don't let this touch you. if you do this you can basically follow it around and not take any damage. When he does it again, now he will have two, and so on. When it gets TOO MUCH, and you NEED to move... move a LONG way away to a different spot in the room and then fight him there instead. The other winds will continue but they are nowhere near you so it is now a fresh start. Stay HERE now until it gets too much and move again. Rinse repeat.\n\nIn larger rooms, this becomes much easier, but in small rooms, it is very tricky.  Bear in mind, however, his lights and heavies ARE hard-hitting so some people may prefer to kite him, but you are going to have to really watch your feet placement. it gets very dramatic.\n\nHe's not easy! Spacial awareness is KEY!\n\n",
					iamechanic = "|t24:24:xynode/icons/xynode_boss_over.dds|t|cffff00 MARAUDER HILKARAX |r|t24:24:xynode/icons/xynode_boss_over.dds|t\n\nMarauder Hilkarax is who we refer to on stream as 'Windy B*llocks', he can make the WHOLE room hate you. So watch your feet!\n\n|cffff00Mechanics|r\n\nOutside of his light and heavy attacks which should be blocked or dodge rolled, this boss does TWO major different attacks.  The first one is a Geyser that he spawns that spits a large fast-moving circular aoe in front of him. When he does this, simply stand out of his face and let it pass.\n\nThe second major mechanic is he will spin in the air and fill the room with multiple winds that spin all over the place. You need to watch your feet and avoid them. BUT look carefully at his feet. Where he CASTS this, there is a very slow-moving wind that moves around in a circle. Stay close to him and don't let this touch you. if you do this you can basically follow it around and not take any damage. When he does it again, now he will have two, and so on. When it gets TOO MUCH, and you NEED to move... move a LONG way away to a different spot in the room and then fight him there instead. The other winds will continue but they are nowhere near you so it is now a fresh start. Stay HERE now until it gets too much and move again. Rinse repeat.\n\nIn larger rooms, this becomes much easier, but in small rooms, it is very tricky.  Bear in mind, however, his lights and heavies ARE hard-hitting so some people may prefer to kite him, but you are going to have to really watch your feet placement. it gets very dramatic.\n\nHe's not easy! Spacial awareness is KEY!\n\n"
				},
			[382] = 
				{
					name = "MARAUDER ULMOR",
					mechanic = "|t24:24:xynode/icons/xynode_boss_over.dds|t|cffff00 MARAUDER ULMOR |r|t24:24:xynode/icons/xynode_boss_over.dds|t\n\nMarauder Ulmor is on stream known as 'WATER BOY!' You guessed it, that's HIS element!\n\n|cffff00Mechanics|r\n\nThis boss is MOSTLY a melee target. he has fast-paced light attacks and a BIG heavy attack that needs to be blocked, If you cannot take the hits you may need to opt to kite him but he IS fairly fast. BUT you have moments to take advantage of his 'stand still' phases. BOTH of these are similar. He hovers and BURSTS with a HUGE aoe which you can block, carefully dodge, or get OUT of. TWO mechanics are like this, one is an explosion the other is a wave but both are just BIG circles.\n\nif you are kiting him, stay out of it and hit him while he is channeling. if you are face-tanking him, MAKE SURE you block/dodge or get out of it. Else it IS a one-shot!\n\nThis is arguably the easiest one of the 3 Marauders but he is still more than capable of deleting players!\n\nGOOD LUCK!\n\n",
					iamechanic = "|t24:24:xynode/icons/xynode_boss_over.dds|t|cffff00 MARAUDER ULMOR |r|t24:24:xynode/icons/xynode_boss_over.dds|t\n\nMarauder Ulmor is on stream known as 'WATER BOY!' You guessed it, that's HIS element!\n\n|cffff00Mechanics|r\n\nThis boss is MOSTLY a melee target. he has fast-paced light attacks and a BIG heavy attack that needs to be blocked, If you cannot take the hits you may need to opt to kite him but he IS fairly fast. BUT you have moments to take advantage of his 'stand still' phases. BOTH of these are similar. He hovers and BURSTS with a HUGE aoe which you can block, carefully dodge, or get OUT of. TWO mechanics are like this, one is an explosion the other is a wave but both are just BIG circles.\n\nif you are kiting him, stay out of it and hit him while he is channeling. if you are face-tanking him, MAKE SURE you block/dodge or get out of it. Else it IS a one-shot!\n\nThis is arguably the easiest one of the 3 Marauders but he is still more than capable of deleting players!\n\nGOOD LUCK!\n\n"
				}

}



